{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_shwaz_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_shwaz_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "普通的一天",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_shwaz_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "40811ab87bfa9111f519bfdefb550693c43fcac18f2ab5c107b64e8543defff9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "請用茶，小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "唉，過了明天，又要有一段時間喝不到你泡的紅茶了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "等我完成本年度的教官任務後，我會申請調職的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "這種時候，你就應該說“既然大小姐這麼希望的話，那我就不回去了”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "既然如此，那我待會就遞交離職申請。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "那還是算了。你真的辭職的話，我可是要被本艦的人記恨死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "好了，我該去辦事處了。我記得你白天在治安局對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "嗯，查理最近因為一群流寇的事情忙得不可開交，託我幫他帶一帶新人，我等一下就過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "那就晚上見吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "晚上六點，“純白火山”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "老爺？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "黑，你現在有空嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "查理找我，不過還有點時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "錫蘭的事情，我想問問你的意見，我在“純白火山”等你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "老爺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "時間過得真快啊，黑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "很久以前，我和芭芭拉也常來這樣的餐吧消磨時光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "您從沒說過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "很多事情在心裡藏久了，就沒了說出來的慾望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "但是，我居然讓我的女兒從其他人那裡聽說她母親的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "這是我的責任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "您想和小姐聊聊夫人的事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "生日派對是個不錯的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "我只怕，我願意說，她不願意聽了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "小姐會聽的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "您只需要做好心理準備，同時承受她的怨氣就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "……哈哈，說得也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "那我該多做一些準備，多告訴她一些她母親的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "對了。大概是66年的時候，那年，維多利亞把議會裡的所有人都弄得焦頭爛額。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "芭芭拉那時候就在火山上做研究了，那裡沒有訊號，無法隨時保持聯絡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "結婚紀念日那天，我們約好，我去火山腳下接她，然後我們一起去餐廳吃飯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "結果，那天我臨時有一個脫不開身的政府會議要參加。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼的聲音",
      "text": "等我趕到火山腳下的時候，天已經暗下來了，預訂好的餐廳用餐時間也錯過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼的聲音",
      "text": "我當時很沮喪，覺得一切都完了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "（低聲）嘿，笨蛋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "她沒有生氣，反而安慰我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "當我在夕陽下，看著她的側臉時，我忽然像是得到了上天的指引一樣——在路邊摘了幾朵花。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "噢，不是火山預警花，就是那種，在火山腳下隨處可見的花朵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "赫爾曼說著，拿起餐桌上插在水杯中的裝飾花，像是身臨其境一般，遞向身邊的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "我把花朵插在她的髮梢，然後向她遞出了求婚戒指。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "你覺得這段往事怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "服務生",
      "text": "呃，市長先生，謝謝您的花……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "嗯？黑呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "服務生",
      "text": "不太清楚，我也是聽到動靜才從廚房出來看一看的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "放開我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "先生，你的錢包。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "text": "什麼——？！這個可惡的小鬼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "text": "跟我過來，我要帶你去治安局！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "我不去，放開我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "把他交給我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "text": "你是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "她就是治安局的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "text": "你、您是赫爾曼市長？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "相信我，交給這位小姐吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "text": "市長先生都這麼說了，我當然相信您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "你可以走了，小子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "……你不打算抓我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "你想被我抓去治安局嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "不想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "那就走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "下次再被我抓到，我會帶你去比治安局更可怕的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "……哼，別以為我會被你嚇唬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "為什麼放過他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "他的腳上有些礦灰，他的衣服也不像是他自己的衣服……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "而且，我剛才抓住他的時候，在他的身上看到了一些源石結晶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "你的意思是，他可能和私挖黑曜石的工人有關？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "既然如此，那不是更該交給治安局？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "查理知道怎麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "他未必知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "回來之後，我去過一趟治安局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "你覺得查理做得不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "不，我走之前對他的交代他都完成得還不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "但有些事情，當時的我也沒想到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "現在還來得及。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "小姐和我提過一位佩利佩先生的事情，我想見他一面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "text": "私挖黑曜石的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "text": "你找錯人了，女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "text": "火山都噴發了，現在還有誰會反對市長當時的決策？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "text": "大家都接受啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "火山剛剛噴發完，對某些人來說，這是最好的發財機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "text": "……你懷疑他們買通了一些私挖黑曜石的工人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "text": "如果我不告訴你，是不是就輪到我大禍臨頭了，前治安局局長，黑女士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "不，我會自己找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查理",
      "text": "老大，按照你的要求，我讓新人們換上了礦工的裝備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "現在開始，忘了你們是治安局的人，你們只是一群打算去火山上冒險的礦工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礦工們？",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查理",
      "text": "老大，你打算讓他們裝成礦工引出那群流寇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "不，我打算讓他們真的去學習礦工們是怎麼生活的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "如果能引出那群流寇最好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查理",
      "text": "我能問問為什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "只有讓他們理解私挖黑曜石的人都在做什麼，他們才能在未來真正地解決這個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查理",
      "text": "這是……錫蘭大小姐的意思嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……這確實像是小姐會說的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "但這是我的意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查理",
      "text": "……我知道了，我也去換一套衣服吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "走吧，路上再換。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "text": "……等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "text": "我答應過那位錫蘭小姐，在她想做事的時候，會幫她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "text": "現在看來，幫你也是一樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "text": "交給我吧，我來幫你們牽線。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "你們就是新來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礦工？",
      "text": "小孩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "對我尊重一點！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "沒我帶路，你們別想找到黑曜石！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礦工？",
      "text": "抱、抱歉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "哼，你們又是為什麼冒著這麼大的風險來挖礦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礦工？",
      "text": "佩利佩那個老頭給我們找的工作實在賺不了多少錢，我們是真的缺錢……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "哼，赫爾曼那個老頭子也真是糊塗，放著這麼一座金山不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "都知道規矩吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礦工？",
      "text": "當然，絕對不洩密，絕對不怕死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "沒錯，我們可不像佩利佩那麼假惺惺，只要你有礦，我們就給你錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "跟我來吧，下面還有許多你們的同伴呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "你們就在這裡好好工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礦工？",
      "text": "好的，好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男孩消失在山洞的深處，渾然不知，在他的身後，有一雙眼睛在盯著他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看門的賞金獵人",
      "text": "情況怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "新來的這批看起來都蠻強壯的，應該能挖不少黑曜石出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看門的賞金獵人",
      "text": "不錯，進去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看門的賞金獵人",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看門的賞金獵人",
      "text": "怎麼感覺有什麼東西過去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看門的賞金獵人",
      "text": "算了，這種地方怎麼可能有其他人來，多半是錯覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "（低聲）和預想的差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "（低聲）營地顯然是火山爆發後建成的，能在短時間內找到這麼深的地方，對方恐怕早就滲透進礦工之中了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "（低聲）人數在二十個左右。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "（低聲）那個孩子……應該就在前面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "聽說你今天去了城裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "你、你怎麼知道的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "我應該告訴過你，不要隨便進城，也不要引人注目。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "你們又不給我錢，又不讓我出去透透氣，我快要悶死了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "你知不知道你差點被這座城市最危險的傢伙抓到？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "也不知道她發什麼瘋，居然把你放了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "那個女人很危險嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "哼，你以為我們為什麼躲在這種地方，就是怕觸了那尊瘟神的楣頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "還有羅德島。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "幸好該賺的也賺得差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "傳下去，讓兄弟們準備卸貨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的賞金獵人",
      "text": "好啊！終於要走了，我都要被這鬼地方熱死了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "卸貨……是什麼意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "既然你要成為我們的一員，確實也該告訴你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "卸貨的意思，就是殺了下面那群礦工，然後帶著黑曜石和錢走人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "為什麼要殺了他們？下面還有一批新人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "那就算他們倒楣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "如果你真的想幹這一行，這就是你必須要上的一課——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "永遠不要留下後患。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "他們見過你，你見過我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "所以，如果你不想被我們殺死，你想成為我們的一員——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "那他們就得死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "別忘了是誰在你父母死後把你從礦洞裡拉出來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "我知道，但是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "你自己說過的，你不想像你父母那樣賺一輩子辛苦錢，你想賺大錢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的賞金獵人",
      "text": "明白了嗎？明白了的話，就給我一個明確的答覆！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "你、你是之前的那個——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我說過，再次見面時，我會帶你去比治安局更恐怖的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "我、我不想殺那些礦工！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "他們都和我爸媽一樣！我、我嚇他們只是好玩！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "現在的時間……是下午三點二十。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "如果把握時間的話，說不定還有機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "把你的眼睛閉上，小鬼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的男孩",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "接下來會發生的事情，對你來說不太好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒等男孩反應過來，黑已經來到他的身邊，將他擊暈，然後扛在肩膀上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "還是這樣更快一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遠處接連響起一些慘叫，那是她事先設好的陷阱。但更多的，是逐漸逼近的腳步聲。\n這讓她想起了獨自一人殲滅仇家的那一夜。\n那時候，她也是孤身一人，面對著數十倍的敵人。\n她想，如果是那時的自己，身邊有這樣一個孩子，她大概是不會做那樣的事的。\n但現在，她覺得這樣是理所當然的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礦工？",
      "text": "您、您居然真的一個人就解決了這群流寇？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我已經和查理說過了，你們分兩隊：一隊清理流寇的據點，一隊安撫受驚的其他礦工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "明白了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礦工？",
      "text": "是！我們馬上就行動！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "等一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礦工？",
      "text": "還有什麼命令？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "把這個孩子——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "這個孩子得了礦石病吧，先讓我檢查一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "這裡比較平坦，把他平放在這裡吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "小姐，你怎麼來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "要不是佩利佩先生不放心，打了個電話給我，我恐怕還要被蒙在鼓裡呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……我一個人能解決。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "病情蔓延得還不算快，應該是最近才感染的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "能把這孩子送去羅德島的辦事處嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礦工？",
      "text": "我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "這個孩子是怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "他是某對私挖黑曜石的礦工夫妻的孩子，他的父母因為礦難去世了，他無依無靠的，就被那些流寇盯上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "流寇們最喜歡吸收這種孩子成為他們的一員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "……我在羅德島上也聽過不少這樣的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "他的性格很頑劣，恐怕短時間內是無法改變的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "那麼，你打算怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我想把他託付給羅德島在汐斯塔的辦事處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "救治礦石病人本來就是我們的責任，更何況他還失去了父母。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我知道了，這件事就交給羅德島辦事處這邊安排吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "好，現在公事算是解決了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "錫蘭說著，拍了一下手掌，臉上露出笑容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "沒受傷吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "嗯，一群流寇而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "剛才那個孩子，我發現他沒有受傷，是你救下來的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "如果不是因為顧慮到這個孩子，你應該能用更少的時間解決裡面的流寇吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "大概……能節省至少十分鐘吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "這樣的話，或許趕得上你的生日派對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "沒關係，我又不會真的因為這種事責怪你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "而且，其實我很高興。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我知道以前的你是什麼樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我花了很長時間適應你的那一面，就像你其實也花了許多時間適應和我一起生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我們為對方改變了一些，但也遷就了一些對方固執的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "比如我對礦石病的執著，比如你做事的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我希望你能回新汐斯塔，但我心裡其實又有些害怕。我怕等我們真的一起工作時，反而會有衝突。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "會嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我想，現在確實不會了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我會等你回來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "不過——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "現在是五點半，從這裡到“純白火山”的車程，至少也要一個小時。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我的生日派對算是泡湯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……老爺現在應該正在“純白火山”等著給你一個驚喜，現在過去還來得及。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "他讓我等了這麼久，現在等我一下也沒什麼關係吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "你的禮物呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我可不允許你用什麼來不及去取之類的藉口蒙混過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她看著自家大小姐的目光，難得有些窘迫。\n這就是錫蘭的性格，想要什麼，就會去爭取。\n她當然準備了禮物，現在它大概還躺在商業街的那家首飾店裡。\n現在開車過去拿，然後再去“純白火山”，應該還來得及。\n她正想這麼說，但這時，她看到落日的餘暉灑在了錫蘭的側臉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "怎麼了，黑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "有了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "這是……花？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "別動，小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我來幫你戴上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "這就是你準備的生日禮物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "火山腳下的野花。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "雖然沒有火山預警花那樣的意義，但是，能夠在火山腳下盛開，本來就代表著堅韌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "而火山是汐斯塔的代表，站在這裡，能夠把新舊汐斯塔的風景都盡收眼底。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "並且，普通的野花，還可以有一層含義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我們都是生活在火山腳下的普通人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "最重要的是——這些花還蠻漂亮的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "好吧，這次就這麼放過你好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "據說，老爺就是這樣挽回了一次和夫人的婚姻危機的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "真的假的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "媽媽那時候，一定和我想到了一樣的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "你可以去向老爺求證一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "黑，你最近很幫他說話嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "老爺也等了一段時間了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "我知道啦，我會和他聊一聊的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "走吧，我還沒吃飯呢，餓死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "明天你沒什麼事情吧？我來幫你收拾行李，順便幫我帶點禮物給本艦的一些朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "這麼說起來，你挑的蛋糕是什麼口味？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "巧克力榛子，你上週說想吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "text": "不愧是黑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "哈——哈啾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "服務生",
      "text": "咦，市長先生，怎麼只有您一個人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "服務生",
      "text": "今天不是錫蘭小姐的生日派對嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "黑那邊出了點狀況，我女兒先去了她那邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "服務生",
      "text": "噢……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "服務生",
      "text": "您不過去沒關係嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "等我知道的時候，黑已經把事情解決了，錫蘭人也在那邊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "我也只能在這裡等她們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "服務生",
      "text": "兩位小姐沒事就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "服務生",
      "text": "咦，您手裡的是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "這是我今天特意去火山腳下採的一束野花。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "服務生",
      "text": "啊，難怪我覺得那麼眼熟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "曾經，我就是用這些花化解了我的婚姻危機。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "今天，希望它們也能化解一些我和女兒之間的隔閡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "服務生",
      "text": "您準備得這麼充分，為什麼我覺得您還是有點愁眉苦臉的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "我只是在剛才忽然有一種感覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "感覺我準備的這招……不管用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫爾曼",
      "text": "……為什麼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
